<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1702487291"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:38.296" ttm:agent="v1000"><div begin="26.467" end="1:05.162" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="26.467" end="34.784" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.467" end="27.617">天上乌云</span><span begin="27.617" end="28.918">终究它会</span><span begin="28.918" end="29.900">散</span><span begin="29.900" end="30.988">开来</span> <span begin="31.455" end="32.644">看见</span><span begin="32.644" end="33.634">了太</span><span begin="33.634" end="34.784">阳</span></p><p begin="36.537" end="45.076" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.537" end="37.179">时</span><span begin="37.179" end="38.577">间将角落</span><span begin="38.836" end="39.139">的</span><span begin="39.139" end="40.831">灰和暗</span><span begin="40.962" end="41.599">都赶</span><span begin="41.599" end="42.301">走</span> <span begin="42.574" end="43.787">露出了色</span><span begin="43.787" end="45.076">彩</span></p><p begin="46.642" end="55.082" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.642" end="47.265">心里</span><span begin="47.265" end="48.595">尘埃终究</span><span begin="48.595" end="49.236">它会</span><span begin="49.236" end="49.993">掉</span><span begin="49.993" end="51.267">下来</span> <span begin="51.639" end="53.876">看见了愿</span><span begin="53.876" end="55.082">望</span></p><p begin="56.801" end="1:05.162" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.801" end="57.391">迷</span><span begin="57.391" end="58.799">蒙的世界</span><span begin="58.986" end="59.387">不再</span><span begin="59.387" end="59.969">将</span><span begin="59.969" end="1:01.203">你我</span><span begin="1:01.203" end="1:02.492">隔开</span> <span begin="1:02.816" end="1:04.117">它没有阻</span><span begin="1:04.117" end="1:05.162">碍</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.500" end="1:27.701" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="1:08.500" end="1:18.225" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:08.500" end="1:09.319">如果只</span><span begin="1:09.319" end="1:10.248">是</span><span begin="1:10.248" end="1:12.158">想回到过</span><span begin="1:12.158" end="1:13.137">去</span> <span begin="1:14.090" end="1:14.908">那明</span><span begin="1:14.908" end="1:15.387">天</span><span begin="1:15.387" end="1:16.128">有什</span><span begin="1:16.128" end="1:18.225">么意义</span></p><p begin="1:18.570" end="1:22.013" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.570" end="1:19.501">知道你</span><span begin="1:19.501" end="1:20.628">不曾埋怨</span><span begin="1:20.628" end="1:21.090">不</span><span begin="1:21.090" end="1:22.013">说抱歉</span></p><p begin="1:22.023" end="1:27.701" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.023" end="1:24.555">离去或伤心的一瞬</span><span begin="1:24.555" end="1:25.142">间</span> <span begin="1:25.517" end="1:26.218">都是清</span><span begin="1:26.218" end="1:27.701">风吹</span></p></div><div begin="1:31.221" end="1:50.745" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:31.221" end="1:36.699" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:31.221" end="1:33.292">我要我一点一点</span><span begin="1:33.292" end="1:34.292">不见</span> <span begin="1:34.612" end="1:35.758">一点一点</span><span begin="1:35.758" end="1:36.699">蜕变</span></p><p begin="1:36.813" end="1:41.408" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:36.813" end="1:37.603">像天</span><span begin="1:37.603" end="1:38.138">使</span><span begin="1:38.138" end="1:40.628">雪白的容颜在你眼</span><span begin="1:40.628" end="1:41.408">前</span></p><p begin="1:41.673" end="1:46.716" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:41.673" end="1:43.196">把它全部打</span><span begin="1:43.196" end="1:44.383">破</span> <span begin="1:44.383" end="1:45.712">全部从</span><span begin="1:45.712" end="1:46.716">头</span></p><p begin="1:47.357" end="1:50.745" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:47.357" end="1:49.458">开始我的新的冒</span><span begin="1:49.458" end="1:50.745">险</span></p></div><div begin="1:51.440" end="2:14.257" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:51.440" end="1:57.021" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:51.440" end="1:52.322">因为我</span><span begin="1:52.322" end="1:53.804">全部我都看</span><span begin="1:53.804" end="1:54.569">见</span> <span begin="1:54.801" end="1:55.980">全部我都</span><span begin="1:55.980" end="1:57.021">听见</span></p><p begin="1:57.120" end="2:01.578" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:57.120" end="1:58.255">拥抱你</span><span begin="1:58.255" end="1:59.030">是唯</span><span begin="1:59.030" end="1:59.629">一</span><span begin="1:59.629" end="2:00.888">我会的语</span><span begin="2:00.888" end="2:01.578">言</span></p><p begin="2:01.874" end="2:07.090" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:01.874" end="2:03.332">当我举起了</span><span begin="2:03.332" end="2:04.574">手</span> <span begin="2:04.824" end="2:05.880">向前</span><span begin="2:05.880" end="2:07.090">走</span></p><p begin="2:07.530" end="2:14.257" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:07.530" end="2:09.746">那激动在我的心</span><span begin="2:09.746" end="2:10.822">头</span> <span begin="2:11.206" end="2:12.163">说不</span><span begin="2:12.163" end="2:14.257">出口</span></p></div><div begin="2:49.853" end="3:07.655" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:49.853" end="2:59.485" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="2:49.853" end="2:50.520">到了</span><span begin="2:50.520" end="2:51.373">明</span><span begin="2:51.373" end="2:53.682">天</span> <span begin="2:54.560" end="2:55.521">都还有</span><span begin="2:55.521" end="2:57.618">明天会接</span><span begin="2:57.618" end="2:59.485">手</span></p><p begin="3:00.592" end="3:07.655" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:00.592" end="3:01.014">不</span><span begin="3:01.014" end="3:04.106">会</span><span begin="3:05.220" end="3:05.673">寂</span><span begin="3:05.673" end="3:07.655">寞</span></p></div><div begin="3:09.746" end="3:29.257" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:09.746" end="3:15.264" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="3:09.746" end="3:11.817">我要我一点一点</span><span begin="3:11.817" end="3:12.973">不见</sp